{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國有線新聞網絡（CNN）報道，一項新研究顯示，歐洲多國在剛過去的夏季因熱浪死亡的人數估計超過5萬，很可能成為該區有紀錄以來最致命的酷暑，其中約三分之二（逾3.26萬宗）死亡個案直接歸因於化石燃料污染引致的氣候變化。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T08:44:12.368644+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T08:10:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T23:18:10.718833+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T08:38:07.517479+00:00","content_hash":"28c4be0dc8cf85f920c12570eeb83de18ca337c56c4e4d04603481dace1b39e7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}